title: "Arabic Deepfake Text Detection on Social Media: Controlled Preprocessing and Cross-Platform Transferability"
abstract: >-
  Research code for a controlled cross-platform study of Arabic deepfake text
  detection on Twitter/X and YouTube, comparing machine learning, sequence and
  transformer models under three preprocessing views, in-domain and under
  bidirectional cross-platform transfer.
